{"title":"Slayer-Captain Orsk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Slayer-Captain Orsk is a named <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a> seen at level 57.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Slayer-Captain Orsk</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2043, 485</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"slayer-captain-orsk\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"virikh-fullhelm\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b0534e1194d81d90e610.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Fullhelm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-mace\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab2218963a9ff8a74162.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Virikh Templars</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/the-ashen-templar\">The Ashen Templar</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Slayer-Captain Orsk</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>57</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,218</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>204 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}